  "The Qing Government approved them for local self-governance.",
  "Only a small group of wealthy men could vote.",
  "Xinjiang skipped them because of low Chinese literacy.",
  "Corruption and vote buying were very common.",
  "Turnout was generally low across the country.",
  "Most winners were divided constitutionalists."
